      "mergedPostDetails": "It seems there was a quiet update to the beta branches that affect in-game spine IK (in the past 48 hrs) where it disconnects my avatars body from its skeleton (videos below)\n\nThings I know:\n\n- It only happens in the VRChat betas\n\n- It is not exclusive to my avatar but is most exaggerated on mine.\n\n- There is no obvious pattern to what avatars will produce the bug or not. I thought it may be constraint based, but I tried it on avatars that are barebones and it still produces the bug.\n\n- Setting “FBT Spine Mode” to “Lock Head” seems to exaggerate it even more (but in all modes it produces the bug)\n\n(videos too large for platform, posted on twitter/x: https://x.com/I3Llamas/status/1949568317150408781)",
